    "description": "Outstanding 2 unit mixed use bldg in hot Outer Parkside. Upper lvl is a huge 3 bed/2ba owner's unit added in 2001 by vert & horizontal addition. Always owner occupied, this fantastic full flr flat has Viking stove, hardwood flrs, 9' ceilings, ensuite master bath. Bright w/4 skylights. X-wide lot provides big rooms. In unit laundry,dir access to gar & yard.  Comm unit rented month to month $2,400 has 12' ceilings, 2 restrooms. A+ location-1 blk to Walgreens, restaurants, & public transit. Mins to Ocean Beach, SF Zoo,Stonestown, freeway. Partner perfect for condo conversion. RM-1 zoning possible conversion of comm space to residential, ck possibilities w/ SF Building Dept. Upper residential unit built in 2001, may be exempt from rent control."
